  "CpG detector uses Gardiner-Garden criteria on 200 bp windows without UCSC post-merge length filtering: both real track islands (MLH1 CpG:93, CDKN2A CpG:156) detected, but 3 islands in a 13 kb island-free desert window and 2 extra calls near CDKN2A are false positives relative to the UCSC cpgIslandExt track",
  "nucleosome occupancy and motif binding energy are heuristic scores, not measured energies",
  "chromatin_graph default contacts are a power-law prior (1+d)^-0.8, not Hi-C data",
  "p53/GC-box/HNF4 motif consensuses follow the canonical literature rather than the fetched JASPAR versions (see jaspar_interpretation)"
